Here is the study in JSON format with logical operators:

```
{
  "AND": [
    {
      "AND": [
        {
          "raw_text": "Provide written informed consent before beginning any study related activities"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "AND": [
        {
          "OR": [
            {
              "raw_text": "Be between age 18"
            },
            {
              "raw_text": "and 55 years"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "AND": [
        {
          "OR": [
            {
              "raw_text": "Be able to speak"
            },
            {
              "raw_text": "read and write English"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "raw_text": "and follow simple instructions for completing self-rated scales"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "AND": [
        {
          "raw_text": "Meet DSM-IV criteria for BPD as assessed by the Structured Clinical Interview for DSM-IV Personality Disorders (SCID-II)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

Note that I used the `AND` and `OR` operators to represent the logical relationships between the conditions. The `raw_text` property is used to store the text of each condition.